# Google OAuth 2.0 Client ID
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create a project (or select your existing one)
# 3. APIs & Services → Enable APIs → enable "Google Calendar API"
# 4. APIs & Services → Credentials → Create Credentials → OAuth 2.0 Client ID
# 5. Application type: Web application
# 6. Authorised JavaScript origins: add http://localhost:8080 (dev) + your production URL
# 7. Copy the Client ID below (no client secret needed for this token flow)
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id-here.apps.googleusercontent.com
